{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109925","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109925/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109925/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109925/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109925","id":3349089746,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6lE1-z","number":109925,"title":"Clarify that velocity doesn't need delta multiplication in CharacterBody documentation","user":{"login":"lazzy-cipher","id":90345171,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzQ1MTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90345171?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazzy-cipher","html_url":"https://github.com/lazzy-cipher","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazzy-cipher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazzy-cipher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazzy-cipher/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazzy-cipher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazzy-cipher/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazzy-cipher/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazzy-cipher/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazzy-cipher/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazzy-cipher/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-08-24T03:13:59Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T10:05:36Z","closed_at":"2025-09-19T02:07:39Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109925","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109925","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109925.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109925.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-19T02:07:38Z"},"body":"## What this PR does\r\n\r\nThis PR clarifies an ambiguity with how to use `velocity` with `delta` and `move_and_slide()` from the `CharacterBody2D` and `CharacterBody3D` nodes.\r\n\r\n## The problem\r\n\r\nAs it stands, Godot 4's documentation does not specify if `velocity` must be multiplied by `delta`. This confuses developers who aren't familiar with the internals of `move_and_slide()`. This is clarified in [Godot 3's class reference](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/3.6/classes/class_kinematicbody2d.html#class-kinematicbody2d-method-move-and-slide).\r\n\r\n### A concrete example of the problem\r\n\r\nFor instance, recently, a client of mine requested consulting help regarding a bug where enemy speed would vary between machines. My client was confused because he multiplied `CharacterBody3D.velocity` by `delta` in `Node._physics_process`. This is intuitive because all other values that must consistently change every frame should be multiplied by `delta`, but `move_and_slide()` [already does that calculation under the hood](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/3defc856b0f1c727b4346e60615b2b2451916837/scene/3d/physics/character_body_3d.cpp#L42). Multiplying by `delta` again runs the simulation at an incorrect speed.\r\n\r\nBefore reading the source code, I researched if multiplying by `delta` was necessary. I googled and asked in the Discord servers, and I mostly found info for Godot 3, and information that was either conflicting or unclear. The CharacterBodies' documentation said nothing, and the [PhysicsBody3D class reference](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_physicsbody3d.html#class-physicsbody3d-method-move-and-collide) was particularly misleading in specifying that the developer must multiply `motion` by `delta`.\r\n\r\nReading the source code easily answered my question, but source code shouldn't be documentation for casual users and common use cases like moving a `CharacterBody3D` each frame. \r\n\r\n## Conclusion\r\n\r\nFrom my experience and according to Godot 3's documentation, it is important to specify that `velocity` does not need to be multiplied by `delta`.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109925/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":3,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109925/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}